{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "wrap analysis of s:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  2x + 1   (i8)\n      nuw holds\n      nsw holds (C requires it: signed overflow is UB)\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "wrap", "ucas": "wrap s", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "wrap", "exhaustive": true, "operations": [{"op": "2x", "type": "i8", "nuw": false, "unsigned_wrap_points": 128, "unsigned_wrap_example": "x=-128", "nsw": false, "signed_wrap_points": 128, "signed_wrap_example": "x=-128", "c_ub": true}, {"op": "2x + 1", "type": "i8", "nuw": true, "unsigned_wrap_points": 0, "nsw": true, "signed_wrap_points": 0, "c_ub": false}], "end_to_end": {"exact": false, "mismatch_points": 128, "mismatch_example": "x=-128", "exact_for": [[-64, 63]]}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "wrap analysis of s:\n  2x   (i8)\n      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      nsw fails: signed wrap at 128 points, e.g. x=-128  <- UB in C; a compiler assumes it cannot happen\n  2x + 1   (i8)\n      nuw holds\n      nsw holds (C requires it: signed overflow is UB)\n  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 128 points, e.g. x=-128\n      exact for: -64..63\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "∫ x^2*sin(x) dx\n  = 2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x) + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [0, 3.14159] (max difference 8.9e-16)\n  from 0 to 3.14159: F(3.14159) - F(0) = 5.86960440108936\n  numeric (adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15, 15 evaluations): 5.86960440108936, estimated error 6.5e-14\n  the two agree to 0\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "integrate", "ucas": "integrate x^2 sin(x) wrt x from 0 to pi", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "integrate", "var": "x", "integrand": "x^2*sin(x)", "antiderivative": "2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x)", "definite": {"from": 0, "to": 3.141592653589793, "symbolic": 5.869604401089359, "numeric": 5.869604401089359, "error_estimate": 6.456564841198295e-14, "evaluations": 15, "value": 5.869604401089359}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "derivative", "points": 401, "max_diff": 8.881784197001252e-16, "passed": true, "text": "d/dx of the antiderivative against the integrand"}, {"kind": "numeric_integral", "points": 15, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "F(b) - F(a) against adaptive Gauss-Kronrod"}], "files": [], "text": "∫ x^2*sin(x) dx\n  = 2x*sin(x) + 2cos(x) - x^2*cos(x) + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [0, 3.14159] (max difference 8.9e-16)\n  from 0 to 3.14159: F(3.14159) - F(0) = 5.86960440108936\n  numeric (adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15, 15 evaluations): 5.86960440108936, estimated error 6.5e-14\n  the two agree to 0\n"}, "isError": false}}
