{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: integers are elements in integer notation (the coefficients as base-2 digits): 0x53 = x^6 + x^4 + x + 1\n0x53^-1 = 0xca = x^7 + x^6 + x^3 + x in GF(2^8, aes)\n  how: a^(q-2) (a^(q-1) = 1 for every nonzero a)\n  check: 0x53 * 0xca = 0x01 (shift-and-add multiplication)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "inverse_mod", "ucas": "inverse 0x53 in GF(2^8, aes)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "inverse", "value": "0xca", "polynomial": "0xca = x^7 + x^6 + x^3 + x", "in": "GF(2^8, aes)", "method": "a^(q-2) (a^(q-1) = 1 for every nonzero a)", "headline": "0x53^-1 = 0xca = x^7 + x^6 + x^3 + x in GF(2^8, aes)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "info", "text": "integers are elements in integer notation (the coefficients as base-2 digits): 0x53 = x^6 + x^4 + x + 1"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "0x53 * 0xca = 0x01 (shift-and-add multiplication)"}], "files": [], "text": "  note: integers are elements in integer notation (the coefficients as base-2 digits): 0x53 = x^6 + x^4 + x + 1\n0x53^-1 = 0xca = x^7 + x^6 + x^3 + x in GF(2^8, aes)\n  how: a^(q-2) (a^(q-1) = 1 for every nonzero a)\n  check: 0x53 * 0xca = 0x01 (shift-and-add multiplication)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 9, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -1\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace t^2 e^-t", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > -1", "roc": "Re(s) > -1", "one_sided": "f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)", "lhs": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s)", "value": "2/(s + 1)^3", "headline": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -1\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
